import{_ as t,o as a,c as i,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 209 | 20% Activation Strategy Realm-Wide Advancement: Activation Ratios and Rhythm by Realm","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 209 | 20% Activation Strategy Realm-Wide Advancement: Activation Ratios and Rhythm by Realm","no":209,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","20% Activation Strategy","Activation Ratio","Rhythm","Realm-Wide Advancement"],"related":["23-20% Activation Strategy Planning","17-Plane Transcendent Standards","75-20% Activation Strategy Implementation"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0209_模块1-20％激活战略全境推进-各境激活比例与节奏.md","filePath":"en/0209_模块1-20％激活战略全境推进-各境激活比例与节奏.md"}'),o={name:"en/0209_模块1-20％激活战略全境推进-各境激活比例与节奏.md"};function r(s,e,l,d,h,c){return a(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-209-20-activation-strategy-realm-wide-advancement-activation-ratios-and-rhythm-by-realm" tabindex="-1">Entry 209 | 20% Activation Strategy Realm-Wide Advancement: Activation Ratios and Rhythm by Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-209-20-activation-strategy-realm-wide-advancement-activation-ratios-and-rhythm-by-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 209 | 20% Activation Strategy Realm-Wide Advancement: Activation Ratios and Rhythm by Realm&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 23, 17, 75</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-activation-is-not-a-slogan-but-a-per-realm-timetable" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Activation is not a slogan, but a per-realm timetable <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-activation-is-not-a-slogan-but-a-per-realm-timetable" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Activation is not a slogan, but a per-realm timetable&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The &quot;20% Activation Strategy&quot; is symbiotic civilization&#39;s core strategy in its early period: within the first epoch after civilization&#39;s establishment, activate 20% of all beings to Plane Transcendent (Origin Realm) level (Documents 17, 23). This entry lands this strategy across the nine realms, explaining how many should be activated at each realm segment, at what rhythm, and why this ratio is not a guess.</p><p>The six top-level axioms are the strategy&#39;s overall goal: the anti-predation axiom requires activation to rely on openness and technology not predation; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the 20% to be distributed among Myriad Races not concentrated in one race; the collective ascension axiom is the reason the strategy exists — activate enough strong ones to lift Myriad Races in ascension; the causal self-discipline axiom requires the activation process not disturb existing karma; the law-first axiom requires the timetable to be versioned, traceable, and not arbitrarily postponed; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-three-stage-activation-rhythm" tabindex="-1">I. Three-Stage Activation Rhythm <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-three-stage-activation-rhythm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Three-Stage Activation Rhythm&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per Documents 17, 23:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Stage</th><th>Time Window</th><th>Origin Realm Activation Ratio</th><th>Supporting Focus</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Short-term</td><td>Within 100 years of civilization establishment</td><td>1%</td><td>Three-hundred systems opened, Multiplication Fruit popularized</td></tr><tr><td>Mid-term</td><td>Within 500 years</td><td>10%</td><td>Joint contracting, mentor network, Youth Supreme cultivation</td></tr><tr><td>Long-term</td><td>Within 1000 years</td><td>20%</td><td>Four-dimensional assessment mature, Plane Transcendents networking</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="ii-funnel-distribution-by-realm-segment" tabindex="-1">II. &quot;Funnel&quot; Distribution by Realm Segment <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-funnel-distribution-by-realm-segment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. &quot;Funnel&quot; Distribution by Realm Segment&quot;">​</a></h2><p>20% is the terminal value for Origin Realm, but activation is a stepwise funnel:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Realm Segment</th><th>Rough Retention Ratio (vs beginners)</th><th>Strategic Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Sense–Condensed</td><td>Extremely high (universal)</td><td>Compulsory education full coverage</td></tr><tr><td>Transform–Law</td><td>High</td><td>Backbone force</td></tr><tr><td>Dao Origin Realm</td><td>Medium</td><td>Master reserve</td></tr><tr><td>Dao Integration–Boundary-Breaking</td><td>Low</td><td>Grandmasters and plane-level</td></tr><tr><td>Origin Realm</td><td>Terminal 20%</td><td>Strategic core target</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Note: terminal 20% is the ratio &quot;activated to Origin Realm,&quot; not &quot;from Sense Origin all the way without dying.&quot; It relies on the three-hundred systems, Multiplication Fruit, and joint contracting to continuously widen the funnel bottom, not on filtering out the majority.</p><h2 id="iii-why-20-not-100" tabindex="-1">III. Why 20% Not 100% <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-why-20-not-100" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Why 20% Not 100%&quot;">​</a></h2><p>A commonly asked question: why not 100% all become Origin strong ones? The answer lies in matching energy level and responsibility: Origin Realm&#39;s power is enough to affect the cosmos; if everyone instantly reached Origin, mind-state and responsibility education cannot keep up, it would instead be a disaster. 20% is the balance point where &quot;strength foundation is enough to support ascension, yet not overwhelming the rhythm of mind-state cultivation.&quot; This is also why activation must advance synchronously with the four-dimensional assessment and ordeal mechanism.</p><h2 id="iv-balanced-distribution-requirement-for-myriad-races" tabindex="-1">IV. Balanced Distribution Requirement for Myriad Races <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-balanced-distribution-requirement-for-myriad-races" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Balanced Distribution Requirement for Myriad Races&quot;">​</a></h2><p>20% is not 20% human. The strategy explicitly requires each of Myriad Races to have its own Transcendent representative: the five genealogies of carbon, energy, mechanical, consciousness, hybrid, and even plant spirits and planetary consciousnesses, should each have proportional seats in the 20%. Otherwise &quot;activation&quot; would degenerate into a single race&#39;s rise, violating the republican axiom of Myriad Races.</p><h2 id="v-long-term-significance-of-the-strategy" tabindex="-1">V. Long-Term Significance of the Strategy <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-long-term-significance-of-the-strategy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Long-Term Significance of the Strategy&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Document 17 points out that the deep meaning of 20% activation is more than cultivating strong ones, but also: providing a power foundation for the cosmos&#39;s overall ascension, preventing individual strong ones&#39; power monopoly, forming an atmosphere of strong ones emerging in succession, and providing a broad strong-one foundation for Myriad Races republicanism. When 20% of beings all reach Origin and practice symbiotic ideals, the cosmos&#39;s overall ascension is no longer a dream.</p><h2 id="vi-buffer-design-behind-the-rhythm" tabindex="-1">VI. Buffer Design Behind the Rhythm <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-buffer-design-behind-the-rhythm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Buffer Design Behind the Rhythm&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The reason 20% activation advances in three hundred, five hundred, one thousand years, not instant universal Origin, is that mind-state education rhythm cannot be compressed by the Multiplication Fruit. Strength can be hundredfold accelerated, but mind-state and responsibility require real ordeals, real co-working, real mistakes and repair to temper. Thus the strategy deliberately binds activation speed to the maturity of the four-dimensional assessment and ordeal mechanism (Entry 186): every activation ratio increase, first confirm supporting ethical review, mentor network, and karmic supervision have kept up. Better to go slower than let a mind-state-unstable strong one rush into Origin Realm — that is not accelerating ascension, but planting a失控火种 in the cosmos.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: activating 20% of strong-one potential, rather than letting 99% of life potential be wasted by old systems</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: activation relies on openness, multiplication, and joint contracting, not predatory filtering</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style civilizations&#39; strong ones rely on bloodline and holy grace, a few in a millennium; Heng Yuan Zhou activates 20% per rhythm, scaled</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: 20% is evenly distributed among Myriad Races groups and life forms</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: activation timetables, funnel models, and supporting technologies are all public and replicable</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-analysis-rhythm-design-of-the-activation-strategy" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Analysis: Rhythm Design of the Activation Strategy <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-analysis-rhythm-design-of-the-activation-strategy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Analysis: Rhythm Design of the Activation Strategy&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The 20% Activation Strategy&#39;s realm-wide advancement rhythm is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s legalized expression of &quot;letting the prosperous first drive the backward.&quot; The Alaya Network monitors each plane&#39;s activation rate; after crossing the 20% threshold it automatically adjusts resource allocation, tilting toward the 80% not yet activated. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization does not pursue simultaneous universal activation — that would cause energy-level dispatch collapse — but advances stepwise. The law-first axiom requires activation rhythm to match the law network&#39;s bearing capacity, not冒进. The universal equal infinite law ensures those 80% not activated are not forgotten or eliminated; they are just walking their own road at their own rhythm.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The 20% Activation Strategy merges &quot;everyone has a road&quot; and &quot;strong ones emerge in succession&quot; into one per-realm timetable. Its endgame is not 20% becoming immortals, but 20% guardians holding up the entire Myriad Races&#39; ascension rhythm.</p><p>In the final analysis, 20% activation strategy realm-wide advancement · activation ratios and rhythm by realm described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./23-20％激活战略规划.html">23-20% Activation Strategy Planning</a> · <a href="./17-位面至高强者标准.html">17-Plane Transcendent Standards</a> · <a href="./75-20％激活战略实施.html">75-20% Activation Strategy Implementation</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const g=t(o,[["render",r]]);export{u as __pageData,g as default};
